    "name": "Next Waves Lead API",
    "description": "Test collection for the Next Waves Lead API backend.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Start server: `npm run dev` (default http://localhost:5000)\n2. Run requests in order from top to bottom on first use\n3. `token`, `apiKey`, and `leadId` are saved automatically by test scripts\n\n**Variables:** Edit collection variables if your server runs on a different port.",
